{"id":"n30117-1-17","stage":1,"title":"청바지 · 牛仔裤","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30117-1-17-1","ko":"너는 청바지가 참 잘 어울리는 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得你穿牛仔裤真的很合适。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청바지가","meaning":"牛仔裤","explanation":"청바지：牛仔裤；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"청바지","audio":"/audio/05e3cf4a063de9b8c59d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30117","senseId":"1","lemma":"청바지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好看地，漂亮地","explanation":"잘：好看地，漂亮地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"10","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어울리는","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b