ation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편하고","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e22229bb260aee03","term":"정장","zh":"正装","audio":"/audio/e22229bb260aee036fe0.mp3","entryId":"31763","definition":"正式场合主要穿的符合礼仪的衣服。","pronunciation":["정ː장"]},{"id":"05e3cf4a063de9b8","term":"청바지","zh":"牛仔裤","audio":"/audio/05e3cf4a063de9b8c59d.mp3","entryId":"30117","definition":"用粗棉布做成的蓝色裤子。","pronunciation":["청바지"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"舒服，舒畅","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"身体或心情不难受，好。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/09112ccc86d655b07220.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.407,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30117","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급"